<urn:atm:triage:finding/RSH-001-LEGACY-AI31>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RSH-001-LEGACY-AI31" ;
  triage:title "PeerPostCommitWorkQueue::run() lacks catch_unwind; panic kills worker permanently" ;
  triage:description "PeerPostCommitWorkQueue::run() (line 144) dispatches hook/graft I/O without catch_unwind wrapping. A panic in the emit_persisted_local_post_write call chain (line 170) permanently kills the worker thread with no restart/supervision path. This is a production-hardening gap in newly-introduced code." ;
